<p id="S3.p12.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.p12.2.1" class="ltx_text">Here we omit the variable <math id="S3.p12.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math> for simplicity. Then, we have</span></p>
<table id="S3.E2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="S3.E2X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
