<p id="S3.p16.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.p16.3.1" class="ltx_text">Notice that <math id="S3.p16.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d(u,v_{0})=k-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d(u,v_{0})=k-1</annotation></semantics></math>.
Then, we can apply the induction hypothesis, which will finish the induction proof.</span></p>
